1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,933
In the Nihon Shoki,

2
00:00:01,933 --> 00:00:04,467
a chronicle of 720,

3
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:05,933
a great star crosses

4
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:08,300
the sky in 637

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,300
with a loud sound.

6
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,600
A monk named Bin

7
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,300
says it is not

8
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,033
a falling star.

9
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:15,333
It is a tengu,

10
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:17,133
a celestial dog.

11
00:00:17,133 --> 00:00:19,233
Its barking sounds
like thunder.

